---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="포코피아 (Pokopia) — 프로젝트 홈"
  description="닌텐도 스위치2 게임 포코피아의 써드파티 클라우드섬 실시간 공유 웹 플랫폼(pokoclouds.com) 프로젝트 홈"
>
  <div class="proj-hub">
    <nav class="proj-breadcrumb" aria-label="이동 경로">
      <a href="/learn/projects">Projects</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="current">포코피아 (Pokopia)</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="proj-hero">
      <div class="proj-hero-copy">
        <div class="proj-pills">
          <span class="proj-pill status">
            <span class="proj-dot"></span>
            COMPLETED · LIVE SERVICE
          </span>
          <span class="proj-pill meta">Flask · Cloudflare Tunnel · i18n (ko/en/ja)</span>
        </div>

        <h1>포코피아 (Pokopia)</h1>
        <p class="proj-desc">
          닌텐도 스위치2 게임 「포코피아」 유저들이 클라우드섬 접속 코드를 실시간으로 올리고 공유할 수 있는 써드파티 웹 플랫폼입니다.
          <strong>Flask 인메모리 API</strong>, <strong>3개 국어(ko/en/ja) 반응형 프론트엔드</strong>, <strong>Cloudflare Tunnel</strong>과
          자동 캐시 버스팅 배포 스크립트로 가볍게 운영할 수 있도록 구축했습니다.
        </p>

        <div class="proj-tags">
          <span>#Python</span>
          <span>#Flask</span>
          <span>#CloudflareTunnel</span>
          <span>#VanillaJS</span>
          <span>#i18n</span>
          <span>#pokoclouds</span>
        </div>

        <div class="proj-actions">
          <a
            href="https://pokoclouds.com"
            class="proj-btn primary"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            pokoclouds.com 열기 ↗
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/pargame/pocopia"
            class="proj-btn secondary"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            GitHub ↗
          </a>
          <a href="/learn/projects" class="proj-btn ghost">
            ← 프로젝트 목록
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a
        href="/learn/projects/pocopia/overview"
        class="proj-thumb"
        aria-label="포코피아 프로젝트 개요 열기"
      >
        <div class="proj-thumb-art">
          <span class="island-badge">CLOUD ISLANDS</span>
          <span class="proj-thumb-domain">pokoclouds.com</span>
          <span class="proj-thumb-label">KO · EN · JA LIVE</span>
        </div>
        <span class="proj-thumb-cap">Pokopia Third-Party Cloud Island Sharing Platform</span>
      </a>
    </header>

    <section class="posts-section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">POSTS IN THIS PROJECT</span>
        <h2>포스팅 선택</h2>
        <p>웹 서비스 아키텍처, API 및 스팸 방지 정책, 배포 자동화 구성을 정리했습니다.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="post-cards">
        <a href="/learn/projects/pocopia/overview" class="post-card">
          <div class="post-top">
            <span class="post-type">POST 01 · 서비스 개요</span>
            <span class="post-arrow">→</span>
          </div>
          <h3>클라우드섬 공유 플랫폼 아키텍처 &amp; 운영 설계</h3>
          <p>
            Flask 인메모리 저장소 기반 REST API, IP·쿨타임·코드 유효성 필터링 정책, 다국어 프론트엔드 폴링 구조 및 <code>launchd</code> + Cloudflare Tunnel 운영 자동화를 정리했습니다.
          </p>
          <div class="post-tags">
            <span>#FlaskAPI</span>
            <span>#RateLimiting</span>
            <span>#CloudflareTunnel</span>
            <span>#CacheBusting</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .proj-hub {
    --p-accent: #10b981;
    --p-accent-2: #06b6d4;
    --p-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 30%, var(--border));
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .proj-hub {
    --p-accent: #059669;
    --p-accent-2: #0891b2;
  }

  .proj-breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-bottom: -1.6rem;
  }
  .proj-breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--text-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .proj-breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--p-accent);
  }
  .proj-breadcrumb .current {
    color: var(--p-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .proj-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--p-border);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 16%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 14%, transparent), transparent 45%),
      var(--surface-1);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
  }
  .proj-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .proj-pill {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .proj-pill.status {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--p-accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 12%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .proj-dot {
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--p-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--p-accent);
  }
  .proj-pill.meta {
    color: var(--text-2);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .proj-hero-copy h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 1.4rem + 1.4vw, 2.4rem);
  }
  .proj-desc {
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  .proj-desc strong {
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .proj-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }
  .proj-tags span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    color: var(--p-accent);
  }
  .proj-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }
  .proj-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.58rem 1.05rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .proj-btn.primary {
    background: var(--p-accent);
    color: #052e16;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .proj-btn.primary {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .proj-btn.primary:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.08);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .proj-btn.secondary {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .proj-btn.secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--p-accent);
    color: var(--p-accent);
  }
  .proj-btn.ghost {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .proj-btn.ghost:hover {
    border-color: var(--p-accent);
    color: var(--p-accent);
  }

  .proj-thumb {
    display: block;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform var(--dur), border-color var(--dur), box-shadow var(--dur);
  }
  .proj-thumb:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--p-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px -10px color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .proj-thumb-art {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 28% 25%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 24%, transparent), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 75% 75%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent-2) 22%, transparent), transparent 55%),
      var(--surface-2);
  }
  .island-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 40%, transparent);
    color: var(--p-accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 12%, transparent);
  }
  .proj-thumb-domain {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .proj-thumb-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--p-accent-2);
  }
  .proj-thumb-cap {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.73rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .section-head {
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--p-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .section-head h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
  }
  .section-head p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  .post-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.3rem;
  }
  .post-card {
    background: var(--surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--p-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.7rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .post-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: var(--p-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px -12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .post-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .post-type {
    color: var(--p-accent);
  }
  .post-arrow {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    transition: transform var(--dur-fast), color var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .post-card:hover .post-arrow {
    color: var(--p-accent);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .post-card h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .post-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .post-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding-top: 0.4rem;
  }
  .post-tags span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .proj-hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
